#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:2
msgid "Hidden states"
msgstr "隐藏状态"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:4
msgid ""
"The **HiddenStateStore** caches per-token *hidden-state* tensors "
"(intermediate activations from an inference forward pass) alongside the "
"KV cache, keyed by the same chunk keys. It exists to support any system "
"where a downstream stage needs an upstream stage's intermediate "
"activations for the cached prefix and cannot reconstruct them from KV "
"alone — for example a vLLM-Omni ``thinker -> talker`` pipeline, where the"
" talker consumes the thinker's hidden states for tokens whose KV the "
"engine restored without re-running prefill."
msgstr "**HiddenStateStore** 会将每个 token 的 *hidden-state* 张量（推理前向传递中的中间激活）与 KV Cache 一起缓存，使用相同的块键进行键控。它的存在是为了支持任何下游阶段需要上游阶段的中间激活用于缓存前缀且无法仅通过 KV 重建它们的系统——例如 vLLM-Omni ``thinker -> talker`` 管道，其中 talker 使用 thinker 的 hidden states 来处理引擎在不重新运行 Prefill 的情况下恢复 KV 的 token。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:14
msgid ""
"Without this store, restoring KV alone causes downstream stages to see "
"truncated or wrong activations for the cached prefix. With it, the talker"
" (or any equivalent consumer) gets a contiguous "
"``[num_cached_prefix_tokens, hidden_dim]`` tensor matching the KV prefix "
"LMCache restored."
msgstr "如果没有这个存储，仅恢复 KV 会导致下游阶段看到截断或错误的缓存前缀激活。有了它，talker（或任何等效消费者）将获得一个连续的 ``[num_cached_prefix_tokens, hidden_dim]`` 张量，与 LMCache 恢复的 KV 前缀匹配。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:21
msgid "Enabling it"
msgstr "启用它"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:23
msgid "Set three keys in the LMCache YAML (``LMCACHE_CONFIG_FILE``):"
msgstr "在 LMCache YAML（``LMCACHE_CONFIG_FILE``）中设置三个键："

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:33
msgid ""
"``enable_hidden_state_cache`` — master switch. When ``false`` (the "
"default), ``engine.hidden_state_store`` is ``None`` and integrators must "
"skip all HS APIs on that worker."
msgstr "``enable_hidden_state_cache`` — 主开关。当为 ``false``（默认值）时，``engine.hidden_state_store`` 为 ``None``，集成者必须跳过该工作者上的所有 HS API。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:36
msgid ""
"``max_hidden_state_cpu_size`` — pinned-CPU pool size in GiB, dedicated to"
" hidden states. Must be ``> 0`` when the store is enabled. The pool is "
"**independent** of the KV pool; HS allocator pressure never evicts KV."
msgstr "``max_hidden_state_cpu_size`` — 专用于隐藏状态的固定 CPU 池大小，以 GiB 为单位。当存储启用时，必须大于 0。该池与 KV 池**独立**；HS 分配器压力永远不会逐出 KV。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:40
msgid ""
"``hidden_state_layers`` — optional allowlist of ``layer_idx`` values "
"accepted on ``store_hidden_states``. Leave unset to accept all layer "
"indices. Use this only when you know exactly which hook indices the "
"worker writes (e.g. matching a fork's hybrid multimodal hook list)."
msgstr "``hidden_state_layers`` — 可选的 ``layer_idx`` 值白名单，适用于 ``store_hidden_states``。如果接受所有层索引，请保持未设置。仅在您确切知道工作者写入哪些钩子索引时使用（例如，匹配分叉的混合多模态钩子列表）。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:47
msgid "Using it from a worker"
msgstr "从工作线程使用它"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:49
msgid "The store is exposed on the engine (not as engine-level methods):"
msgstr "存储在引擎上公开（不是作为引擎级方法）："

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:68
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "注意事项："

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:70
msgid ""
"``token_ids`` is always the **full** prefix so chunk keys align with KV "
"exactly. ``token_offset`` lets incremental callers (such as vLLM-Omni) "
"pass only the newly computed rows in ``hidden_states`` without zero-"
"padding the already-cached prefix."
msgstr "``token_ids`` 始终是**完整的**前缀，因此块键与 KV 完全对齐。``token_offset`` 允许增量调用者（如 vLLM-Omni）仅传递 ``hidden_states`` 中新计算的行，而无需对已缓存的前缀进行零填充。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:74
msgid ""
"``layer_idx`` is the *storage* layer index. Callers that need several "
"intermediate tensors per request (e.g. multimodal hook outputs *plus* the"
" main text hidden state) call ``store_hidden_states`` once per distinct "
"``layer_idx`` and retrieve per layer on restore."
msgstr "``layer_idx`` 是*存储*层索引。需要每个请求多个中间张量的调用者（例如，多模态钩子输出*加上*主要文本隐藏状态）会针对不同的 ``layer_idx`` 调用一次 ``store_hidden_states``，并在恢复时按层检索。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:79
msgid ""
"``retrieve_hidden_states`` is **prefix-strict**: it returns the longest "
"contiguous CPU ``float32`` prefix where every chunk has both KV and HS "
"for the requested ``layer_idx``, and stops at the first chunk where "
"either is missing."
msgstr "``retrieve_hidden_states`` 是**前缀严格**的：它返回最长的连续 CPU ``float32`` 前缀，其中每个块都有请求的 ``layer_idx`` 的 KV 和 HS，并在第一个缺少其中之一的块处停止。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:85
msgid "Eviction model"
msgstr "逐出模型"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:87
msgid "The store implements a **coupled-but-asymmetric** eviction rule:"
msgstr "该存储实现了一种**耦合但不对称**的逐出规则："

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:89
msgid ""
"**KV evicted ⇒ HS evicted.** On every ``retrieve_hidden_states`` the "
"store asks the KV ``StorageManager`` whether KV is still present for each"
" chunk key. If KV is gone, the orphan HS entry is dropped and the "
"returned prefix ends there."
msgstr "**KV 逐出 ⇒ HS 逐出。** 每次调用 ``retrieve_hidden_states`` 时，存储会询问 KV ``StorageManager`` 每个块键的 KV 是否仍然存在。如果 KV 不在了，孤立的 HS 条目将被删除，返回的前缀到此结束。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:93
msgid ""
"**HS evicted ⇏ KV evicted.** Pressure on the HS pinned pool only evicts "
"HS entries (its own LRU), never KV."
msgstr "**HS 逐出 ⇏ KV 逐出。** 对 HS 固定池的压力只会逐出 HS 条目（其自身的 LRU），而不会逐出 KV。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:95
msgid "**Restore stops at first missing HS or KV chunk** for the requested layer."
msgstr "**恢复在第一个缺失的 HS 或 KV 块处停止**，针对请求的层。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:99
msgid "Design notes (user-visible)"
msgstr "设计说明（用户可见）"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Separate pinned pool from KV.** KV tensors and hidden-state tensors "
"have heterogeneous shapes and dtypes, so they get independent allocators."
" ``max_hidden_state_cpu_size`` sizes the HS pool only."
msgstr "**将固定池与 KV 分离。** KV 张量和隐藏状态张量具有异构的形状和数据类型，因此它们获得独立的分配器。``max_hidden_state_cpu_size`` 仅为 HS 池设置大小。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Same chunk keys as KV.** The store reuses the engine's "
"``TokenDatabase`` so HS chunks share the exact ``CacheEngineKey`` as the "
"matching KV chunks. This is what enables the lazy coupled eviction check."
msgstr "**与 KV 相同的块键。** 存储重用引擎的 ``TokenDatabase``，因此 HS 块与匹配的 KV 块共享完全相同的 ``CacheEngineKey``。这使得懒惰耦合逐出检查成为可能。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Lazy coupled-eviction check.** No callbacks or shared indices are "
"required between KV and HS — the store asks "
"``storage_manager.contains(key)`` per chunk on retrieve. Works uniformly "
"for any backend that implements ``contains()``."
msgstr "**惰性耦合逐出检查。** 在 KV 和 HS 之间不需要回调或共享索引——存储在检索时对每个块调用 ``storage_manager.contains(key)``。适用于实现了 ``contains()`` 的任何后端。"

#: ../../source/non_kv_cache/hidden_states.rst:114
msgid ""
"The full internal design (class layering, code paths, follow-up work) "
"lives at :file:`docs/design/v1/hidden_state_store.md` in the source tree."
msgstr "完整的内部设计（类分层、代码路径、后续工作）位于源码树中的 :file:`docs/design/v1/hidden_state_store.md`。"

